Wordfence Intelligence Vulnerability Database
---------------------------------------------

WPProbe retrieves vulnerability data from the Wordfence Intelligence API and
redistributes a processed copy of that data as a release asset in this
repository (tag `db`, file `wordfence_vulnerabilities.json`).

